OL,3,GNEWSATube drivers to stage strikes in
OL,4,AChristmas run-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FLondon Underground drivers are to stage
OL,7,Fa series of 24-hour strikes in a
OL,8,Flong-running dispute over working
OL,9,Farrangements, the Rail, Maritime and
OL,10,FTransport (RMT) union has announced.
OL,12,FA series of walkouts will begin on 26
OL,13,FNovember, with further strikes planned
OL,14,Ffor 17 December, 19 December, 4
OL,15,FJanuary, 6 January, 17 February, 23
OL,16,FFebruary and 25 February.
OL,18,FThe action will be taken in opposition
OL,19,Fto Transport for London (TfL) plans to
OL,20,Fintroduce a four-day working week.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
